{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Retrospective Mode — Captura de Aprendizados Pós-Atividade",
    "subtitle": "3 estágios sequenciais (explorer → retrospective-capture → doc-writer) + task-manager paralelo no estágio final",
    "animation": "trace",
    "visual_preset": "signal-flow",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "output": "flow-retrospective-mode.workflow.html",
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "retrospective",
        "label": "Pipeline de retrospectiva",
        "focus": ["explorer", "retrospective_skill", "doc_writer", "task_manager"],
        "note": "Coleta evidência → analisa/filtra proposals → codifica em artefatos duráveis."
      },
      {
        "id": "handoffs",
        "label": "Handoffs + gates",
        "focus": ["retrospective_skill", "task_manager"],
        "note": "Threshold confidence ≥ 70; result file ≤ 300 linhas; memories atualizadas."
      }
    ]
  },
  "lanes": [{ "id": "agent", "label": "Agent Runtime" }],
  "phases": [
    { "id": "collect", "label": "Coletar", "fromCol": 0, "toCol": 1, "variant": "emphasis" },
    { "id": "write", "label": "Codificar", "fromCol": 2, "toCol": 3, "variant": "dashed" }
  ],
  "groups": [
    {
      "id": "collect_phase",
      "label": "Coletar + analisar",
      "lane": "agent",
      "fromCol": 0,
      "toCol": 1,
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "write_phase",
      "label": "Codificar artefatos",
      "lane": "agent",
      "fromCol": 2,
      "toCol": 3,
      "variant": "dashed"
    }
  ],
  "mainPath": ["explorer", "retrospective_skill", "doc_writer"],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "explorer",
      "lane": "agent",
      "col": 0,
      "type": "external",
      "label": "explorer",
      "sublabel": "diff + conversation",
      "tag": "≥ 3 decisões/patterns",
      "width": 160
    },
    {
      "id": "retrospective_skill",
      "lane": "agent",
      "col": 1,
      "type": "security",
      "label": "retrospective-capture",
      "sublabel": "filtrar por confidence",
      "tag": "threshold = 70",
      "width": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "doc_writer",
      "lane": "agent",
      "col": 2,
      "type": "external",
      "label": "doc-writer",
      "sublabel": "result file ≤300 linhas",
      "tag": "b<N>+1-result.md",
      "width": 160
    },
    {
      "id": "task_manager",
      "lane": "agent",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "task-manager",
      "sublabel": "backlog das proposals",
      "tag": "paralelo ao doc-writer",
      "width": 160,
      "yOffset": 120
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "explorer-to-skill",
      "from": "explorer",
      "to": "retrospective_skill",
      "label": "raw_evidence",
      "variant": "emphasis",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-to-writer",
      "from": "retrospective_skill",
      "to": "doc_writer",
      "label": "proposals filtradas",
      "variant": "default",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill-to-task",
      "from": "retrospective_skill",
      "to": "task_manager",
      "label": "proposals paralelas",
      "variant": "dashed",
      "role": "async"
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Pipeline Híbrido",
      "items": [
        "3 estágios sequenciais (explorer → retrospective-capture → doc-writer)",
        "task-manager paralelo no estágio final (prepara backlog das proposals)",
        "Cada handoff tem expected_output + success_criteria binário (pass/fail)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Gates de Saída",
      "items": [
        "Result file escrito em memory/b<N>+1-result.md com frontmatter + linked memories",
        "0 proposals com confidence < 70 (abaixo disso vira comentário no result)",
        "Memory files dos agents envolvidos atualizados (git diff verificável)",
        "PR opcional aberto se proposals de harness (skills/conventions)",
        "MEMORY.md index atualizado com apontador para o result",
        "pnpm ci:preflight passa (cross-refs em memory/, agents, skills)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Quando NÃO usar",
      "items": [
        "Atividades triviais (typo, dep bump) — overhead puro",
        "Quando o plano ainda está em curso (executar retrospectiva quando ciclo review+fix já aprovado)",
        "Como substituto para task-mode (gestão de backlog sem retrospectiva)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
